cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Cite this software and reproduction release. The software DOI was reserved
  at archive assembly; publication is handled separately.
type: software
title: 'Neural topic modelling of fibroblast measurements and diabetic foot ulcer
  healing: analysis software and reproduction archive'
authors:
- family-names: Fu
  given-names: Zeyu
version: 0.5.0
license: MIT
abstract: A patient-level audit of frozen neural topic measurements in diabetic foot
  ulcer research. The release includes the producing analysis programs, public processed
  inputs, numerical evidence, fixed model states, mappings, and corrected journal
  documents. Healing inference uses eleven discovery patients. The analysis evaluates
  measurement decomposition, technical sensitivity, topic selection, refits and tissue
  context; it does not establish prospective healing prediction or independent clinical
  validation.
repository-code: https://github.com/PeterPonyu/wound-measurement-construct
keywords:
- single-cell transcriptomics
- wound healing
- measurement validity
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23308073
